# Worktrees a delivery run creates inside the repository, one per role. They
# must be ignored rather than merely uncommitted: an untracked directory here
# would appear in `git status --porcelain` and therefore change the working-tree
# fingerprint the delivery process takes to decide whether a tester run left
# the tree alone.
.claude/worktrees/
